    "https://www.wheatoncollege.edu/academics/life-and-career-design-institute/": {
      "title": "Life and Career Design Institute",
      "description": "Life and Career Design Institute - Wheaton College Massachusetts Skip to main content Skip to main content Navigation menu Alumni Athletics Giving Parents & Families insideWheaton Visit Get Info Apply Give Now Academics Academics Academic Calendar Accreditation Academic Advising College Catalog Departments Faculty Directory Global Education Library Life and Career Design Institute Programs Projects & Initiatives Provost Summer Session The Wheaton Curriculum Winter Session Admission Admission Admitted Students Applying to Wheaton Scholarships Information for Counselors International Students Meet the Admission Staff Picture #WheatonMA Transfer Students Tuition & Fees Visiting Wheaton Campus Life Campus Life Athletics and Recreation Clubs & Organizations Dean of Students First Year Resources Health & Wellness Housing & Dining Marshall Center Safety on Campus Wheaton Orientation Programs About Wheaton About Wheaton Campus & Community Diversity, Equity, Inclusion & Belonging History & Traditions Honor Code Mission and Vision Offices & Services Outcomes & Impact President & College Leadership Sustainability Facts and Figures The Wheaton Edge Working at Wheaton Search What can we help you find? type keywords here Search Visit Wheaton Learn about how and when you can visit our campus Request Info Receive announcements and materials based upon your academic interests. Apply Now Ready to apply? Check out our requirements and deadlines. × Visit Get Info Apply Give Now Life and Career Design Institute Home » Academics » Life and Career Design Institute More in this section Life and Career Design Institute Employers Faculty Meet the Staff Parents Students At Wheaton, we are committed to providing a transformative experience. That’s why we’ve reimagined our career services to create new opportunities to enhance your personal, academic and professional growth. The Life and Career Design Institute at Wheaton augments our high-quality education with innovative design thinking to help you learn skills and build a mindset for success in college and throughout your life and career. What is Life and Career Design? Life and career design uses design thinking principles to help you make informed choices about which direction to take. With our Life and Career Design Cycle, you’ll learn strategies to create meaningful experiences at Wheaton and develop a life and career path that aligns with your interests, values and desired lifestyle. From your first day at Wheaton and beyond, you’ll receive individualized support and collaborate with a Career Navigator to explore your interests and varied career paths. Then connect your goals through courses, clubs, and experiential learning opportunities. Plus, you’ll make career connections on campus, within our alumni network and through external organizations. Best of all, you’ll gain life-long skills to help you navigate the inevitable challenges life throws your way—both professionally and personally. Meet Your Career Navigator Are you ready to start designing your college to career roadmap? Simply login to Handshake to schedule an appointment or stop by our Life and Career Design Institute located in Kollett Hall. Schedule an Appointment How Does it Work? You’ll receive personalized coaching tailored to your journey, using our Life and Career Design Cycle. This iterative process helps you reflect on experiences, maximize resources, tell your story, and take action. You’ll develop custom systems that work just for you to build confidence and resilience to achieve your goals. SELF: Build self awareness and understanding Identify your values, strengths and goals. SYSTEM: Develop a plan to access support and opportunities Test self-awareness and apply classroom learning in career-oriented activities and experiential learning. STORY: Craft a coherent and compelling story Through guided reflection, you’ll learn how to make sense of your path and communicate it in a clear and meaningful way. SYNTHESIS: Synthesize your learning experiences Understand where you’ve been and create a plan for a successful path forward. Who We Serve The Life and Career Design Institute is not just for students. We proudly serve the entire Wheaton community! Here are just some of the ways we can help. Students Learn about the ways we can help you find and prepare for jobs and internships and plan your career trajectory. Student Resources Employers Gain access to an extraordinary pool of Wheaton talent by posting jobs and internships with us, or hosting on-campus or virtual interviews and events. Employer Resources Alumni Share opportunities and knowledge with the Wheaton community, build your Wheaton network, or access support for your own career journey. Alumni Resources Families Learn ways to engage with your student and the college to champion your students’ success. Family Resources Faculty Partner with us to discuss workshops, seminars, departmental visits and other ways to connect classroom learning to careers. Faculty Resources Staff Connect with the Life and Career Design Institute to learn how to apply design thinking principles to your Wheaton career. Contact Us Get Hired View All Jobs Jobs Team Member Services Administrative Assistant at Piedmont Airlines Source: Handshake - Jobs Published on: 2026-09-03 Data Scientist at U.S. Department of Health and Human Services Source: Handshake - Jobs Published on: 2026-09-02 Supervisory Logistics Management Specialist at U.S. Department of Health and Human Services Source: Handshake - Jobs Published on: 2026-09-02 Internships 2D and 3D Exhibit Designer Intern at ET Global Limited Partnership Source: Handshake - Internships Published on: 2026-08-28 Venture and Program Support Intern at UTEP Woody L. Hunt College of Business Dean's Office Source: Handshake - Internships Published on: 2026-08-21 Campus Marketing & Community Intern — End of Summer/Fall at MTR Beauty Collective, LLC. Source: Handshake - Internships Published on: 