pate in school events, cultural celebrations, and ongoing professional development. We are seeking someone who:Is a native or near-native Mandarin Chinese speaker and is committed to speaking Mandarin Chinese with students throughout the school day.Has experience working with toddlers or preschool-aged children.Creates engaging, hands-on learning experiences that spark children's curiosity and enthusiasm.Understands child development and provides a nurturing, developmentally appropriate classroom environment.Is warm, patient, energetic, and playful.Collaborates effectively with colleagues and families.Embraces a culturally responsive approach to teaching and values diverse perspectives and experiences.Meets Maryland requirements for early childhood instructional staff. Why The New Century School? The New Century School is a vibrant independent school serving preschool through eighth grade. Our students benefit from a unique language immersion program in both Mandarin Chinese and Spanish, giving children the opportunity to develop fluency through authentic daily experiences. We value curiosity, creativity, cultural understanding, and joyful learning, and we support our teachers with a collaborative, welcoming community.  If you are passionate about early childhood education and believe that young children learn language best through joyful immersion, we invite you to apply. Join our team and become part of a community that values bilingualism, curiosity, creativity, and the joy of learning. The New Century School is an equal opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees. Fri, 7 Aug 2026 17:53:32 +0000 https://wheatonma.joinhandshake.com/jobs/11285279/share_preview gid://handshake/Job/11285939 Pharmacist - Full-time Floater - Haines City, FL at Publix Super Markets Employer: Publix Super Markets \n\n Expires: 09/07/2026 \n\n As a Publix Pharmacy Associate, you’ll see how very satisfying it is to w